      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{60285ca04963ba22994f485b|full_name}: My Sign&Fun or Party world can used as test, but if you like i can make example world. You need in Quest side to see problem.\nSign&Fun: go to Art Room. Open the photo orb (it's light blue sphere)  and walk inside with your face down. You will pushed away. Look straight forward allows you go inside.\nPhoto orb at PC side is also there, but it uses another shader.\nTo experience trigger boxes problem, i can make demo world with many trigger boxes for quest. I know already PC game world with triggers worked just fine, where you look at it. But Quest has weird side, you must not look down, or you will pushed away.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
